{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Grothendieck构造"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Grothendieck 构造"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>对于范畴 $\\mathcal C$, Grothendieck 构造将函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ 等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维范畴","text":"纤维范畴"}},{"Plain":" $p\\colon \\mathcal E \\to \\mathcal C$, 其在 $x\\in\\mathcal C$ 处的纤维为 $F(x)$.</p>\n<p>换言之, 范畴的范畴 $\\mathsf{Cat}$ 上有万有的纤维范畴. 这也是一种"},{"Local":{"url":"分类空间","text":"分类空间"}},{"Plain":"的观念.</p>\n"}]}}